                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='39103' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98770' x='615' y='20903'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>The dashboard has two main pages. Please find the questions that can be answered in each page below.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>1) How is the distribution of customers&apos; firstly preferred payment methods in a day? What customers prefer on their first attempt and what are the order statuses?</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>2) What is the customers&apos; last action after a failed order attempt? Do they try again? If they do, do they change the payment method?</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Definitions</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Order: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>An order is intended customer purchase by date, restaurant, and basket amount. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Order Payment Success Rate:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'> successfully paid orders / all orders</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Order Payment Recovery Rate: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>first failed then successfully paid orders with different PM / all orders</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Order Fail Rate:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'> failed payment orders / all orders</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Acceptance Rate:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'> Order Payment Success Rate + Order Payment Recovery Rate</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>*Please note that the dashboard currently covers only </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Pandora</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='12'> and </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Talabat</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontsize='12'> platforms</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
